WEBVTT

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.296
with the attitude
that we had both lost a son.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:32.576
My son died.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.840
He lost his grandson
to the adult prison system.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.736
And I asked him to join me.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:41.136
As you see, 22 years later,
we are still here together,

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.936
because I can't bring Tariq
back from the dead,

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.016
you can't take Tony out of prison,

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.016
but the one thing we can do

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.096
is make sure no other young people
in our community

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.680
end up dead or end up in prison.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.936
With the grace of God,

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.856
the Tariq Khamisa Foundation
has been successful.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.696
We have a safe school model